### SpiceAuth - Email Verification & Password Reset Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@email = test@example.com
@username = testuser
@password = Password123!

### 1. Create Registration Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/registration/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Get Pending Registrations (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registration/pending

### 3. Approve Registration (Admin)
# Replace {requestId} with actual ID from step 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/registration/{requestId}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Approved for testing"
}

### 4. Check Email Logs
# Look in console/logs for verification email with token

### 5. Verify Email
# Replace {token} with token from email logs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### 6. Try Login (should work after verification)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 7. Test Failed Login (wrong password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "WrongPassword123!"
}

### 8. Test Account Lockout (5 failed attempts)
# Run this 5 times to trigger lockout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "WrongPassword123!"
}

### 9. Request Password Reset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### 10. Check Reset Token Validity
# Replace {token} with token from email logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/validate-reset-token?token=PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### 11. Reset Password
# Replace {token} with token from email logs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_HERE",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 12. Login with New Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 13. Resend Email Verification
# Replace {userId} with actual user ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 14. Check Username Availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/check-username?username={{username}}

### 15. Check Email Availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/check-email?email={{email}}